hat some people are unable to connect.", "message": "This incident has been resolved.", "impact": "minor", "timestamp": "Oct <var data-var='date'>13</var>, <var data-var='time'>20:53</var> - <var data-var='time'>20:58</var> PDT"}, {"code": "rhvp2tn7g0zc", "name": "502 Errors - API Unavailability", "message": "Everything looks resolved at this time.", "impact": "critical", "timestamp": "Oct <var data-var='date'>13</var>, <var data-var='time'>16:04</var> - <var data-var='time'>18:01</var> PDT"}, {"code": "xdykd8rmntbn", "name": "Connectivity Issues", "message": "This incident has been resolved.", "impact": "none", "timestamp": "Oct <var data-var='date'>3</var>, <var data-var='time'>10:51</var> - <var data-var='time'>11:30</var> PDT"}]}, {"name": "September", "year": 2016, "starts_on": 4, "days": 30, "incidents": [{"code": "ss950h2r6w8r", "name": "Brazil - Connectivity Issues.", "message": "This incident has been resolved.", "impact": "minor", "timestamp": "Sep <var data-var='date'>30</var>, <var data-var='time'>14:06</var> - <var data-var='time'>14:21</var> PDT"}, {"code": "9tfy4lhmbq6s", "name": "EU Issues", "message": "Everything appears to be A-OK at this time.", "impact": "none", "timestamp": "Sep <var data-var='date'>24</var>, <var data-var='time'>14:59</var> - <var data-var='time'>21:11</var> PDT"}, {"code": "9r8fqf7z5c6r", "name": "Guilds Unavailable", "message": "Service should be 100% restored at this point. \r\n\r\nAs always, apologies for any interruptions this caused. We're still getting to the bottom of this. This incident was caused by another attempted update to our server code. We're going to hold off on performing this kind of update until we're 100% sure that we've got this fixed.\r\n\r\nEdit: ~5:30 am PDT, there was a lingering issue causing DMs to notify the client for approximately 1/3rd of users. It also should be fixed now.", "impact": "minor", "timestamp": "Sep <var data-var='date'>24</var>, <var data-var='time'>02:42</var> - <var data-var='time'>03:26</var> PDT"}, {"code": "t6b15n68pckr", "name": "Awaiting Endpoint for a small handful of servers.", "message": "We pushed out a temporary fix for the awaiting endpoint bug and will have a permanent fix for it at some point today. Sorry for the trouble!", "impact": "none", "timestamp": "Sep <var data-var='date'>23</var>, <var data-var='time'>13:42</var> - <var data-var='time'>15:06</var> PDT"}, {"code": "17zyg7398yj4", "name": "Connectivity Issues/Unavailable Guilds", "message": "Everything looks 100% operational now. Apologies for the service interruption. A routine code upgrade caused a cascading failure in our system. \r\n\r\nWe're still investigating the root cause of why this happened - and hope to ensure stuff like this doesn't happen again in the future.", "impact": "major", "timestamp": "Sep <var data-var='date'>23</var>, <var data-var='time'>02:33</var> - <var data-var='time'>04:11</var> PDT"}, {"code": "8586tnwxjx5k", "name": "US-East Datacenter Issue", "message": "This incident has been resolved.", "impact": "none", "timestamp": "Sep <var data-var='date'>20</var>, <var data-var='time'>17:45</var> - <var data-var='time'>21:42</var> PDT"}, {"code": "p7lwm5nm7x20", "name": "US-East Datacenter Issue", "message": "This incident has been resolved.", "impact": "none", "timestamp": "Sep <var data-var='date'>19</var>, <var data-var='time'>22:16</var> - Sep <var data-var='date'>20</var>, <var data-var='time'>01:20</var> PDT"}, {"code": "wzhsfwj4mmj0", "name": "Higher API Latency", "message": "This one was a tricky one - but we isolated the issue and it looks resolved now. We're doing a full post-morterm to get down to the root cause and fix it for good.", "impact": "none", "timestamp": "Sep <var data-var='date'>19</var>, <var data-var='time'>09:01</var> - <var data-var='time'>10:21</var> PDT"}, {"code": "24pv4cxfblp7", "name": "Connectivity Issues", "message": "This issue appears to have been caused by upstream networking issues.", "impact": "none", "timestamp": "Sep <var data-var='date'>8</var>, <var data-var='time'>08:46</var> - <var data-var='time'>09:03</var> PDT"}]}, {"name": "August", "year": 2016, "starts_on": 1, "days": 31, "incidents": [{"code": "fhz97w2swjxl", "name": "Embeds not Embedding", "message": "Looks like whatever was causing the hiccup has resolved itself. And the backlog of unfurling embeds has finished. \r\n\r\nWe suspect an upstream ISP/transit provider had some issues.", "impact": "none", "timestamp": "Aug <var data-var='date'>31</var>, <var data-var='time'>13:02</var> - <var data-var='time'>13:11</var> PDT"}, {"code": "ts7wv984xrq0", "name": "Issues creating new servers and calls", "message": "This issue has been resolved.", "impact": "none", "timestamp": "Aug <var data-var='date'>26</var>, <var data-var='time'>15:54</var> - <var data-var='time'>16:06</var> PDT"}, {"code": "gxbxvhsxthgq", "name": "Packet loss in US East for Comcast customers", "message": "Comcast has resolved the issue.", "impact": "minor", "timestamp": "Aug <var data-var='date'>21</var>, <var data-var='time'>16:08</var> - <var data-var='time'>17:00</var> PDT"}, {"code": "yvkhyxs5bqlk", "name": "Voice Server Performance Issues - EU Regions", "message": "The data center has resolved the issues. We are very sorry for if this service disruption caused any issues. We are working on expanding on EU footprint to be able to minimize impact of such events in the future.", "impact": "minor", "timestamp": "Aug <var data-var='date'>21</var>, <var data-var='time'>13:40</var> - <var data-var='time'>16:05</var> PDT"}, {"code": "xxy7d1fwqbn2", "name": "Failed Message Sends/Loads Again", "message": "All clear!\r\n\r\nWe're working through some growing pains with our messages cluster - and hope to have this issue permanently resolved soon.", "impact": "none", "timestamp": "Aug <var data-var='date'>12</var>, <var data-var='time'>08:54</var> - <var data-var='time'>10:21</var> PDT"}, {"code": "83tv5l1fxysp", "name": "Message Sends/Loads Slow", "message": "We've identified the root cause of this issue and have deployed a fix.", "impact": "none", "timestamp": "Aug <var data-var='date'>10</var>, <var data-var='time'>15:48</var> - <var data-var='time'>17:48</var> PDT"}, {"code": "sddyvl0mkkz5", "name": "Messages not loading/sending", "message": "The database repair operation attempted earlier has completed without issue - and we're noticing no further issues at this time.", "impact": "minor", "timestamp": "Aug <var data-var='date'>10</var>, <var data-var='time'>01:20</var> - <var data-var='time'>02:51</var> PDT"}, {"code": "3gr99wmv6c77", "name": "Failed message sends", "message": "The issue is now resolved. For users who are locked out of their current account due to 2FA. Please contact our support team at support@discordapp.com and we'll assist you in getting back into your account. We apologize for the trouble and inconvenience that this may have caused.", "impact": "minor", "timestamp": "Aug <var data-var='date'>8</var>, <var data-var='time'>10:40</var> - <var data-var='time'>15:57</var> PDT"}, {"code": "13z2pklz3074", "name": "A wild connectivity issue has appeared.", "message": "This incident has been resolved.", "impact": "major", "timestamp": "Aug <var data-var='date'>1</var>, <var data-var='time'>09:42</var> - <var data-var='time'>10:35</var> PDT"}]}], "show_component_filter": false, "show_uptime_calendar": true, "component_filter": null, "start_time": "2016-08-01T00:00:00-07:00", "end_time": "2016-10-31T23:59:59-07:00"}